OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FShowers, heavy at times,
OL,6,Fgenerally ease through the day. Winds
OL,7,Fbecome light, with dry and sunny
OL,8,Fspells for many later. Temperatures
OL,9,Fnear average for late October.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry, clear and rather mild
OL,12,Fnight, with mist and fog patches
OL,13,Fforming in many areas in the early
OL,14,Fhours.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FMist and fog patches
OL,17,Fsteadily clear through the morning,
OL,18,Fwith a dry and sunny day following for
OL,19,Fmany. Light winds and temperatures
OL,20,Fnear normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
